674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OTyV0DZP6bMQ7kNvwHFL1_q&_nc_oc=AdpstOTKDxrYhioJo_sV9bjs13Omn2woIJI43-2uCeAFxtgmpl8m_kK8Dup5menL_xw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7cDRAylpwABIoXQ5c_QK7w0JOD2UOjS3SaAg88Wj93gw&oe=6A1AF4D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RiBQjvOAZvoQ7kNvwH-vjpE&_nc_oc=AdqNgYzjRvUinhL1OASVonattJO4TaIcKn9wjylN1J3ZWRCvba2MfNbawcKFWiNvVSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af47X-obgV3ve2v5c4mE7dmuvXRzLvGm0ajqS_h6kxXJhg&oe=6A1AFD96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HUv4BVkoDXgQ7kNvwEChIoa&_nc_oc=AdrGQZEIdtFNyg1zHdwERbuUbrzRq5JnirJftpbYTW-zD8h1Xlow6Ud9LvYQ3NHk9RQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af59Mlc57-pEWNvC6v7v5CbGOAyNbJTuWGNtBc8W8LyV1A&oe=6A1AF9B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip